WEBVTT

00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:14.830
Whoa!

00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:19.370
So that's Fenrir's Forest?

00:00:19.370 --> 00:00:25.330
The home of all beasts as well as all life...

00:00:25.330 --> 00:00:28.410
So we have to go through there?

00:00:28.410 --> 00:00:30.040
Yup.

00:02:20.160 --> 00:02:23.950
"Deep Dragon"

00:02:40.370 --> 00:02:42.700
Say, Majic.

00:02:42.700 --> 00:02:45.120
What's that you've been humming?

00:02:45.120 --> 00:02:48.000
Oh, it's nothing important.

00:02:49.580 --> 00:02:52.910
I don't mind the humming but keep your eye out.

00:02:52.910 --> 00:02:54.620
Sure thing.

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:05.500
I disturb thee, Cage of Light!

00:03:09.620 --> 00:03:13.410
Hey, it feels like I'm being watched...

00:03:13.410 --> 00:03:17.910
I'm sure you're just imagining it.
I mean, there was that ranger station nearby,

00:03:17.910 --> 00:03:20.830
but there's no one around here.

00:03:20.830 --> 00:03:22.700
Are you sure?

00:03:24.450 --> 00:03:29.290
I see... So you were concentrating
so hard on being a Peeping Tom

00:03:29.290 --> 00:03:31.580
that you didn't see me standing in front of you.

00:03:31.580 --> 00:03:33.000
Wh-What are you talking about?

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:35.410
I was just looking out for her.

00:03:35.410 --> 00:03:38.330
You use sound as a medium for Sorcery.

00:03:38.330 --> 00:03:40.250
Humming counts as sound.

00:03:40.250 --> 00:03:43.950
As long as there's sound,
the Sorcery will go in effect.

00:03:43.950 --> 00:03:46.790
You used your humming to make light refract

00:03:46.790 --> 00:03:50.870
and were looking in on an angle that
you shouldn't be able to otherwise.

00:03:50.870 --> 00:03:54.700
W-Well done, Master! Nothing gets past you--

00:03:54.700 --> 00:03:57.040
Stop calling me "Master"!

00:03:57.040 --> 00:04:00.000
Listen up. I never made you my apprentice.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:02.950
I'm only teaching you a few things
because you're paying me every month.

00:04:02.950 --> 00:04:05.580
Wouldn't that make me your apprentice then?

00:04:05.580 --> 00:04:08.870
Majic? Is someone there?

00:04:08.870 --> 00:04:11.080
Don't ever do that again.

00:04:13.250 --> 00:04:16.620
He gets so serious over the weirdest things.

00:04:16.620 --> 00:04:19.040
Majic! Are you actually watching?!

00:04:19.040 --> 00:04:21.540
Yeah, don't worry!

00:04:21.540 --> 00:04:23.040
Stop looking!

00:04:23.040 --> 00:04:25.200
Gather at my command--

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:31.580
You can't be serious.

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:37.250
It took me three years and four months
to even get the hang of Sorcery.

00:04:37.250 --> 00:04:41.250
I only started teaching
that little brat two weeks ago.

00:04:41.250 --> 00:04:43.250
I didn't even teach him anything that big,

00:04:43.250 --> 00:04:44.660
and yet he managed to pull that off.

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:51.290
At this rate, he's probably going
to become a Sorcerer within a year.

00:04:55.450 --> 00:04:57.910
Peek in on me again, and it'll mean death.

00:04:57.910 --> 00:05:00.950
You've got it all wrong!
You called me, so I just happened to look!

00:05:00.950 --> 00:05:04.120
Pretty pathetic that you couldn't dodge a rock.

00:05:04.120 --> 00:05:07.830
Well, if I could use
Sorcery like you, I could've...

00:05:07.830 --> 00:05:12.410
Well... I guess you at least look the part.

00:05:12.410 --> 00:05:15.950
Copying Orphen and dressing in all black.

00:05:15.950 --> 00:05:20.830
O-Of course, I did. As his apprentice,
I should dress like my master.

00:05:20.830 --> 00:05:24.660
You totally borrowed that
shirt from Orphen, didn't you?

00:05:24.660 --> 00:05:27.000
You cheeky little boy.

00:05:28.120 --> 00:05:32.500
Says the person who's wearing my pants.

00:05:33.660 --> 00:05:37.660
Who would've guessed that we wore the same size?

00:05:37.660 --> 00:05:41.790
Yeah, right. I saw you adjusting the length.

00:05:44.250 --> 00:05:45.620
So...

00:05:45.620 --> 00:05:48.160
How long does it take to get to Tafrem?

00:05:48.160 --> 00:05:51.450
About three weeks
after we get through the forest.

00:05:51.450 --> 00:05:54.510
So, what's Tafrem like?

00:05:52.950 --> 00:05:54.410
Hey, be careful!

00:05:54.410 --> 00:05:56.410
Come on, tell me, Master!

00:05:56.410 --> 00:05:58.540
There's really nothing to say.

00:05:58.540 --> 00:06:00.700
Since I want to be a Sorcerer,

00:06:00.700 --> 00:06:05.120
both Tafrem and the Tower of Fangs
are fascinating to me!

00:06:05.120 --> 00:06:09.410
Neither one's that impressive...
Neither Tafrem nor the Tower of Fangs.

00:06:09.410 --> 00:06:11.330
Huh?

00:06:11.330 --> 00:06:13.830
That goes for Sorcerers, too.

00:06:20.910 --> 00:06:23.080
Why are we taking a detour?

00:06:23.080 --> 00:06:24.450
Oh, hey.

00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:26.200
Isn't that a ranger station?

00:06:26.200 --> 00:06:29.870
If the rangers report that
they saw a Sorcerer in the forest,

00:06:29.870 --> 00:06:33.000
the royal family will report
that to the Kimluck Church.

00:06:33.540 --> 00:06:35.200
The Kimluck Church?

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:39.040
The royal family and the
Kimluck Church watch over this forest.

00:06:39.040 --> 00:06:44.330
The Kimluck Church?
We didn't really see them in Totokanta.

00:06:44.330 --> 00:06:48.620
They're a religious organization
that's as influential as the royal family.

00:06:48.620 --> 00:06:52.370
They hold a grudge against Sorcerers.

00:07:00.450 --> 00:07:03.290
Do you still...

00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:08.250
Do you still not know?

00:07:14.450 --> 00:07:19.500
Damn it... I had more than
enough food to last me a month.

00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:22.830
But my supply's sure depleting
fast thanks to a couple of stowaways.

00:07:22.830 --> 00:07:27.580
That's why we should've went around
the forest and stopped by Alenhatam.

00:07:27.580 --> 00:07:30.950
We could've definitely gotten more food there.

00:07:30.950 --> 00:07:34.790
Not to mention, you eat way
too much canned food, Orphen.

00:07:36.080 --> 00:07:39.950
What choice do I have?
You said leave the cooking to you,

00:07:39.950 --> 00:07:42.790
but everything you made
couldn't be considered food.

00:07:42.790 --> 00:07:46.830
--Hey! Don't you dare think
I'm going to let that slide!
--Wait, don't fight!

00:07:46.830 --> 00:07:49.580
I'll go look for some food.

00:07:49.580 --> 00:07:51.660
Okay?

00:07:51.660 --> 00:07:53.580
Don't wander off too far.

00:07:53.580 --> 00:07:57.620
I'll be fine. It's not like
I'll get lost. I'm not a kid.

00:08:06.450 --> 00:08:10.750
Man, I'm totally lost.

00:08:10.750 --> 00:08:13.790
Master's definitely going
to give me a hard time later.

00:08:13.790 --> 00:08:18.660
He always makes me do like
500 squats whenever he gets mad.

00:08:21.660 --> 00:08:23.910
I-It's huge!

00:08:25.580 --> 00:08:28.080
Gather at my command...

00:08:28.080 --> 00:08:29.910
...Shield of Amber!

00:08:33.700 --> 00:08:36.080
This time, it turned out the way I learned it.

00:08:36.080 --> 00:08:37.290
That's great.

00:08:37.290 --> 00:08:38.290
A Sorcerer?

00:08:38.290 --> 00:08:39.700
Huh?

00:08:41.040 --> 00:08:42.330
Who's there?

00:08:42.330 --> 00:08:44.660
You're a Sorcerer, aren't you?

00:08:44.660 --> 00:08:48.580
Huh? Uh... Yeah.

00:08:48.580 --> 00:08:50.450
Who are you?

00:08:50.450 --> 00:08:52.910
What are you doing in the middle of this forest?

00:08:52.910 --> 00:08:56.700
I should ask you the same thing.
What are you doing here?

00:08:56.700 --> 00:09:03.000
W-Well... I was just looking
for some food for my master.

00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:04.160
You master?

00:09:04.160 --> 00:09:08.370
Oh, he's a Sorcerer teaching me Sorcery...

00:09:08.370 --> 00:09:11.750
I see. So you must be an apprentice.

00:09:11.750 --> 00:09:18.370
Nuh-uh! One day, I'll be an
amazing Sorcerer just like my master!

00:09:18.370 --> 00:09:21.120
At least that's the plan...

00:09:23.910 --> 00:09:27.660
Your clothes... Are you
a shrine maiden, or something?

00:09:28.910 --> 00:09:33.870
I'm just being controlled
by the power of this forest.

00:09:33.870 --> 00:09:35.540
Power of the forest?

00:09:35.540 --> 00:09:38.160
Please return to your master immediately!

00:09:38.160 --> 00:09:40.330
This forest is very dangerous.

00:09:40.330 --> 00:09:44.330
Dangerous? Then what are you doing here?

00:09:44.330 --> 00:09:48.620
I told you. I'm being controlled
by the power of this forest.

00:09:48.620 --> 00:09:51.330
But it's a very dangerous place
for you and your master.

00:09:51.330 --> 00:09:53.540
I don't think I really understand.

00:09:53.540 --> 00:09:57.700
So... What's your name?

00:09:57.700 --> 00:09:59.790
I'm Fiena.

00:09:59.790 --> 00:10:02.370
Fiena... That's a really lovely name.

00:10:02.370 --> 00:10:04.950
Thanks. What's yours?

00:10:04.950 --> 00:10:07.580
Oh, I'm Majic.

00:10:07.580 --> 00:10:12.200
So, um... Do you live in this forest, Fiena?

00:10:13.790 --> 00:10:18.950
There's a village here,
though you won't find it on a map.

00:10:18.950 --> 00:10:23.290
We call it the Sacred Heart.

00:10:23.290 --> 00:10:25.580
The Sacred Heart?

00:10:25.580 --> 00:10:29.750
Would they be able to spare us
some food if we go there?

00:10:29.750 --> 00:10:35.000
I'm very sorry, but I won't
be able to take you there.

00:10:35.000 --> 00:10:39.080
Like I said, this place
is very dangerous for you.

00:10:39.080 --> 00:10:40.290
Why though?

00:10:40.290 --> 00:10:42.950
Because you're a Sorcerer.

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:50.910
This forest belongs to us. Those who
enter without permission shall be punished.

00:10:50.910 --> 00:10:55.330
The punishment will be
worse if you're a Sorcerer.

00:10:55.330 --> 00:10:58.870
Then you must belong to the Kimluck Church...

00:10:58.870 --> 00:11:00.870
The Kimluck Church?

00:11:01.830 --> 00:11:04.910
What could those fools possibly do?

00:11:04.910 --> 00:11:06.870
Please wait, MacDougal!

00:11:06.870 --> 00:11:09.370
He's just an apprentice...

00:11:09.370 --> 00:11:11.790
The true Sorcerer is the one he's with.

00:11:11.790 --> 00:11:16.500
And we've got someone
heading towards them right now.

00:11:16.500 --> 00:11:18.620
To Master and Claiomh?

00:11:18.620 --> 00:11:21.040
Fiena, you may be a shrine maiden,

00:11:21.040 --> 00:11:24.830
but you'll also be punished
if you get in our way.

00:11:25.750 --> 00:11:28.580
Don't worry about me, Fiena.

00:11:30.500 --> 00:11:33.620
That's not the best idea, Fiena.

00:11:39.370 --> 00:11:40.830
They really are here!

00:11:40.830 --> 00:11:43.160
You must be a Sorcerer!

00:11:43.160 --> 00:11:45.120
Are you okay, Claiomh?

00:11:45.120 --> 00:11:48.660
My precious bean soup...

00:11:47.000 --> 00:11:48.660
That's what you're worried about?

00:11:48.660 --> 00:11:52.330
Remember, don't kill them.
Make sure to take them alive.

00:11:52.330 --> 00:11:54.040
So you've got some weapons.

00:11:54.040 --> 00:11:55.910
I guess this forest is
more dangerous than I thought.

00:11:55.910 --> 00:11:59.410
Don't even think about resisting.
We've got your friend.

00:12:00.250 --> 00:12:03.620
Take that!

00:12:03.620 --> 00:12:06.120
I'll show you everything
I learned in the soldiers' club!

00:12:06.120 --> 00:12:07.200
Claiomh, don't!

00:12:07.200 --> 00:12:09.330
Why you little...

00:12:17.790 --> 00:12:19.160
Claiomh!

00:12:20.910 --> 00:12:24.750
Out of the way, Fiena.

00:12:24.750 --> 00:12:28.080
I guess we'll just have to
move you out of the way ourselves.

00:12:28.080 --> 00:12:31.290
Um... Do you guys mind if I give a little yell?

00:12:31.290 --> 00:12:33.660
Calling for help won't do you any good.

00:12:33.660 --> 00:12:37.160
We're the only ones around here.

00:12:37.160 --> 00:12:41.330
Yeah, I figured as much...

00:12:41.330 --> 00:12:43.370
Master, you moron!

00:12:43.370 --> 00:12:48.290
I'm paying you every month,
so you need to actually teach me some Sorcery!

00:12:48.290 --> 00:12:51.540
Oh, that was all nonsense, really.

00:12:57.500 --> 00:12:59.080
Let's go!

00:12:59.080 --> 00:13:00.000
Hurry!

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:02.200
I can't! You need to go by yourself.

00:13:02.200 --> 00:13:04.120
Like I can just leave you here!

00:13:04.120 --> 00:13:05.580
You're not getting away!

00:13:13.950 --> 00:13:17.370
You think you're real smart, don't you?

00:13:20.160 --> 00:13:22.910
A gun...?

00:13:29.790 --> 00:13:32.080
Majic?

00:13:32.080 --> 00:13:34.620
Majic!

00:13:35.410 --> 00:13:38.750
I draw thee, Trajectory of Light!

00:13:43.750 --> 00:13:45.410
Come on, Orphen.

00:13:45.410 --> 00:13:51.290
I know they were armed, but that
Sorcery was probably a bit overboard.

00:13:53.160 --> 00:13:55.910
I just saved your life, so stop complaining.

00:13:55.910 --> 00:13:59.910
If what they said was true, then...

00:13:59.910 --> 00:14:02.290
Yeah, I'm pretty sure he was caught.

00:14:02.290 --> 00:14:05.830
Damn that Majic. Causing us even more trouble.

00:14:05.830 --> 00:14:08.080
We're in a hurry here.

00:14:08.080 --> 00:14:10.500
And yet, you're going to save him right now.

00:14:10.500 --> 00:14:12.870
I need those monthly dues.

00:14:12.870 --> 00:14:14.750
It wouldn't kill you to be a little more honest.

00:14:18.870 --> 00:14:20.910
What's the matter?

00:14:22.330 --> 00:14:23.700
Nothing.

00:14:23.700 --> 00:14:26.620
Huh? Wait, what's going on?

00:14:26.620 --> 00:14:31.200
Master Salua, the men we sent to
take care of the Sorcerer aren't back yet.

00:14:31.200 --> 00:14:32.870
Then the Sorcerer must've taken care of them.

00:14:32.870 --> 00:14:34.410
Huh?

00:14:34.410 --> 00:14:36.200
They could attack at any moment.

00:14:36.200 --> 00:14:37.370
Keep your guard up.

00:14:37.370 --> 00:14:38.950
Yes, sir.

00:14:40.950 --> 00:14:43.950
Please protect us, O Master.

00:14:43.950 --> 00:14:45.160
O Master.

00:14:45.160 --> 00:14:50.000
O Master. O Master. O Master. O Master.

00:14:50.000 --> 00:14:54.080
Crap. The villagers here
are definitely bad news.

00:14:54.080 --> 00:14:57.120
To think we'd get captured in a place like this.

00:14:57.120 --> 00:15:03.120
This is all because you tried
to sell them some shady pot!

00:15:04.830 --> 00:15:09.120
And then you had to go tell them
that there's a Sorcerer in the forest.

00:15:09.120 --> 00:15:12.040
The Moneylender's gonna
have our heads when he finds out!

00:15:12.040 --> 00:15:14.040
It's because I gave them that information

00:15:14.040 --> 00:15:17.450
that we just have to do household
chores instead of clean the barn!

00:15:17.450 --> 00:15:18.540
Hey, janitors.

00:15:18.540 --> 00:15:19.790
Gulp!

00:15:19.790 --> 00:15:22.950
I know you're in there. Come out here.

00:15:22.950 --> 00:15:25.910
H-Hey, there, Salua.

00:15:25.910 --> 00:15:28.790
Your information was spot-on.

00:15:28.790 --> 00:15:31.290
There actually was a Sorcerer in the forest.

00:15:31.290 --> 00:15:33.580
I'm honored that I could help you out, sir!

00:15:33.580 --> 00:15:37.950
So, uh... What're you going
to do once you capture them?

00:15:40.500 --> 00:15:43.830
If you want to continue
your jobs as janitors and stay alive,

00:15:43.830 --> 00:15:46.290
you probably shouldn't ask any more questions.

00:15:46.290 --> 00:15:48.120
Y-Yes, sir!

00:15:48.120 --> 00:15:50.750
Make sure you sharpen that knife, will ya?

00:15:50.750 --> 00:15:53.540
I-It'd be an honor!

00:15:56.450 --> 00:15:59.450
We're going to be janitors
for the rest of our lives...

00:15:59.450 --> 00:16:01.330
Th-That cocky bastard!

00:16:01.330 --> 00:16:04.160
I'll beat him to death
with a folding chair next week!

00:16:06.660 --> 00:16:08.000
So it's that village?

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:09.500
Probably.

00:16:09.500 --> 00:16:13.580
Judging from how they're guarding
the place, Majic must be in that tower.

00:16:20.370 --> 00:16:21.450
That flag...

00:16:21.450 --> 00:16:23.870
Is there something about that wolf flag?

00:16:23.870 --> 00:16:25.950
It's not a wolf.

00:16:25.950 --> 00:16:28.500
It's a Deep Dragon.

00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:32.450
No wonder they tried to capture us.

00:16:32.450 --> 00:16:33.750
What do you mean?

00:16:33.750 --> 00:16:38.080
We Sorcerers are their mortal enemies.

00:16:38.080 --> 00:16:41.790
Looks like this is a hidden village
that worships the Dragon Faiths.

00:16:41.790 --> 00:16:43.950
Dragon Faiths?

00:16:43.950 --> 00:16:47.700
There are two main faiths that
are worshiped on this continent.

00:16:47.700 --> 00:16:50.000
The first is the faith that
worships the three goddesses

00:16:50.000 --> 00:16:54.620
known as the Weird Sisters, the Kimluck Church.

00:16:54.620 --> 00:17:00.290
The other is the Dragon Faiths,
where they revere Dragons.

00:17:00.290 --> 00:17:04.410
So Dragon like the one on your pendant?

00:17:04.410 --> 00:17:07.200
This is just a symbol of power.

00:17:07.200 --> 00:17:11.660
Dragon is just a term for those who use Sorcery.

00:17:11.660 --> 00:17:13.790
So does that make you a Dragon, too, Orphen?

00:17:13.790 --> 00:17:16.700
You don't call human Sorcerers "Dragons."

00:17:16.700 --> 00:17:19.000
Didn't you learn anything in school?

00:17:19.000 --> 00:17:21.500
I was always terrible at history.

00:17:21.500 --> 00:17:26.580
So why are Sorcerers your
mortal enemies if you worship Dragons?

00:17:26.580 --> 00:17:31.120
Well, long ago, Sorcery didn't exist.

00:17:31.120 --> 00:17:36.580
The six races of highly intelligent
beasts stole the Magic used by the gods

00:17:36.580 --> 00:17:39.000
and made it so they could use it.

00:17:39.000 --> 00:17:41.370
That's what Sorcery is.

00:17:41.370 --> 00:17:44.120
The six races of beasts that
figured out how to use Sorcery

00:17:44.120 --> 00:17:46.330
were eventually called Dragons.

00:17:46.750 --> 00:17:52.700
Out of the six Dragons, the Weird Dragons,
Nornir, were the most intelligent.

00:17:52.700 --> 00:17:56.540
They were also called Celestials,
but they couldn't leave any heirs,

00:17:56.540 --> 00:17:59.830
so they mixed with the humans.

00:17:59.830 --> 00:18:03.950
And that's how you get us, the human Sorcerers.

00:18:03.950 --> 00:18:07.830
So you're telling me that Sorcerers
are half human and half Dragon?

00:18:07.830 --> 00:18:09.290
Yeah.

00:18:09.290 --> 00:18:12.580
And yet, the mother of
all Sorcerers, the Celestials,

00:18:12.580 --> 00:18:16.950
became enraged, saying that
the humans stole Sorcery from them,

00:18:16.950 --> 00:18:20.120
just like they stole Magic from the gods.

00:18:20.120 --> 00:18:22.370
And then...

00:18:22.370 --> 00:18:26.160
They had humans who were not
Sorcerers worship the Dragons

00:18:26.160 --> 00:18:30.870
and then tried to use them
to eradicate the Sorcerers...

00:18:30.870 --> 00:18:33.290
Otherwise known as the Sorcerer Hunts.

00:18:33.290 --> 00:18:34.910
But then several centuries ago,

00:18:34.910 --> 00:18:38.250
other than the immortal and
original Sorcerers known as the Aureors,

00:18:38.250 --> 00:18:43.160
the Celestials went extinct and
the Sorcerer Hunts also ceased.

00:18:43.160 --> 00:18:46.330
Though people still practice the Dragon Faiths,

00:18:46.330 --> 00:18:52.120
they aren't outwardly as
hostile towards Sorcerers anymore.

00:18:52.120 --> 00:18:57.040
But this is a hidden village that
Sorcerers probably rarely ever passed by.

00:18:57.040 --> 00:19:01.250
Looks like we chose one hell of a place to be.

00:19:01.250 --> 00:19:02.200
Let's go.

00:19:02.200 --> 00:19:04.120
S-Sure...

00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:11.500
Wait, what's that?!

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:13.040
What's that light?

00:19:13.040 --> 00:19:15.450
Those are flames created from Sorcery.

00:19:16.250 --> 00:19:18.870
But that's not human Sorcery.

00:19:34.830 --> 00:19:36.950
Don't tell me...

00:19:36.950 --> 00:19:39.950
A Deep Dragon... A Fenrir!

00:19:39.950 --> 00:19:43.250
No way! It's real? A real Dragon?!

00:19:43.250 --> 00:19:52.500
O Master... O Master... O Master...
O Master... O Master... O Master...

00:19:53.660 --> 00:19:54.450
Claiomh!

00:19:54.450 --> 00:19:55.420
Guess it's my time to shine!

00:19:55.420 --> 00:19:56.200
No!

00:19:56.200 --> 00:19:59.000
Get to the closest ranger station.

00:19:59.000 --> 00:20:00.790
Tell them what's going on and wait there.

00:20:00.790 --> 00:20:03.160
I'm gonna go save Majic, and I'll come find you.

00:20:03.160 --> 00:20:05.330
Wait, why? Why do I have to leave?

00:20:05.330 --> 00:20:07.250
Just shut up and go!

00:20:07.250 --> 00:20:12.040
Fine. But you owe me one.

00:20:15.080 --> 00:20:17.950
If Majic is being held in that tower,

00:20:17.950 --> 00:20:22.040
I need to somehow get past
the Deep Dragon without being seen.

00:20:22.040 --> 00:20:23.250
Who's there?

00:20:23.250 --> 00:20:26.160
You... You must be the Sorcerer.

00:20:29.330 --> 00:20:31.950
First a Dragon, now a gun?

00:20:31.950 --> 00:20:36.370
Pretty sure guns are
outlawed by the royal family.

00:20:36.370 --> 00:20:38.750
I'm the law in this forest.

00:20:38.750 --> 00:20:42.660
I am a servant to the Dragon,
and the leader of the Sacred Heart!

00:20:46.620 --> 00:20:48.790
I unsheathe thee, Sword of--

00:20:55.580 --> 00:20:56.660
Why you!

00:21:00.370 --> 00:21:03.950
Flow thus! Angel Breath!

00:21:06.500 --> 00:21:08.660
That's about enough out of you!

00:21:15.330 --> 00:21:18.120
The Deep Dragon...

00:21:19.660 --> 00:21:21.370
O Master...

00:21:21.370 --> 00:21:27.500
O Master... The silent Dragon Warrior...

00:21:27.500 --> 00:21:30.910
Why are you staring at me?

00:21:30.910 --> 00:21:33.870
So this must be him.

00:21:33.870 --> 00:21:37.250
The one who came to take what's thine.

00:21:37.250 --> 00:21:39.750
I can hear the Deep Dragon?

00:21:41.500 --> 00:21:43.580
O Master...

00:21:43.580 --> 00:21:47.870
O Master... O Master... O Master...

00:21:47.870 --> 00:21:50.290
Why you...

00:21:50.290 --> 00:21:56.200
So you want my powers to protect what's thine?

00:23:38.120 --> 00:23:41.160
Jeez, talk about a detour.

00:23:41.160 --> 00:23:44.500
My father always did tell me
that slow and steady wins the race.

00:23:44.500 --> 00:23:46.950
It's a bit late for that!

00:23:44.950 --> 00:23:46.950
"Forest Maiden"
